ACKNOWLEDGMENTS

This project was developed as the grand prize winning solution at the SpinSci AI 
Hackathon 2025, held on January 14-15, 2025, at T-Hub, Hyderabad, India.

The team would like to thank:
- SpinSci Technologies for hosting the hackathon and providing the problem statement
- T-Hub, Hyderabad for providing the venue and infrastructure
- All mentors and organizers who made this event possible

HACKATHON ACHIEVEMENT

Grand Prize Winner
Event: SpinSci AI Hackathon 2025
Date: January 14-15, 2025
Location: T-Hub, Hyderabad, India

The MVP was developed in just 6.5 hours, demonstrating rapid innovation and 
adaptability under pressure. The solution focused on AI-powered patient engagement 
through automated appointment scheduling, rescheduling, and cancellation via 
voice-enabled real-time calls using Twilio, GPT-3.5, and Ollama.
